            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah in Newcastle"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Mmmmm! I used a melon baller on softly frozen, fresh oranje juice and put it in the glass after pouring the chilled cranberry juice. It made a nice presentation. This is a good healthy drink for kids too!",
            "datePublished": "2007-03-21T09:21:48.840Z"
