            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was an excellent recipe!! I wanted something fast and easy, this was exactly what I wanted it. I was planning this big party for my dog since he was turing 1 and I only had today to plan it. This colorful beverage was perfect and all the guests loved it. Even though the orange juice ice cubes weren't frozen by the time of the party, it worked out great because they melted faster, causing the orange juice to be able to be tasted. excellent.",
